
================================================================================================================
C1 -- ROUTE 1: can the CUSCUTON CLOCK's own potential V(tau) generate the a^-3 dust?
================================================================================================================
  [PASS] C1-1  the cuscuton's FLRW energy density is EXACTLY the potential: rho = taudot L_taudot - L = V(tau) (the kinetic term is degree-1 homogeneous, so it cancels)   (rho = V)
  [PASS] C1-2  and its pressure is P = mu_c^2 |taudot| - V, so P == 0  <=>  V = mu_c^2 taudot   (P = -V + mu_c**2*taudot)
  [PASS] C1-3  DUST IS EXACT ON THIS BRANCH: imposing P=0 (V = mu_c^2 taudot) in the cuscuton constraint V' = -3 mu_c^2 H gives Vdot = -3 H V, i.e. rho = V ~ a^-3 identically, with NO a^-6 partner   (Vdot = -3 mu_c^2 H taudot = -3 H V  =>  rho ~ a^-3 exactly)
  [PASS] C1-4  the required V is a simple QUADRATIC: V(tau) = (mu_c^2/B)(C - tau)^2 reproduces the constraint V'(tau) = -3 mu_c^2 H exactly on the matter-era solution a ~ t^{2/3}   (V' + 3 mu_c^2 H = 0)
  [PASS] C1-5  NUMERICAL: integrating the coupled (tau, a) system with V(tau) = (mu_c^2/B)(C-tau)^2 gives dln(rho)/dln(a) = -3 to machine level -- exact dust, from an action, with no stiff partner   (dln(rho)/dln(a) = -2.999977)
  [PASS] C1-6  NUMERICAL (non-circular): the cuscuton's OWN field equation V'(tau) = -3 mu_c^2 H -- which was never imposed during the integration -- holds along the solution to <1e-10, so the P=0, rho ~ a^-3 branch is a genuine solution of the action rather than a fitted ansatz   (max |V' + 3 mu_c^2 H| / (3 mu_c^2 H) = 2.56e-16)

================================================================================================================
C2 -- ROUTE 1's OBSTRUCTION: the cuscuton dust is NON-PROPAGATING, so it cannot CLUSTER
================================================================================================================
  sqrt(-(d tau)^2) to O(eps^2):  -Psi**2*epsilon**2*taubar_dot/2 - Psi*deltataudot*epsilon**2 - Psi*epsilon*taubar_dot + deltataudot*epsilon - epsilon**2*gradsq/(2*taubar_dot) + taubar_dot
  [PASS] C2-1  the (delta-tau-dot)^2 terms CANCEL IDENTICALLY at second order: the cuscuton has NO time-kinetic term for its perturbation (this is what makes it 0-dof)   (coefficient of eps^2 (delta-tau-dot)^2 = 0)
  [PASS] C2-2  while the SPATIAL gradient survives with coefficient -1/(2 taubar_dot): the quadratic action is PURELY elliptic in delta-tau   (coefficient of (grad delta tau)^2/a^2 = -1/(2*taubar_dot))
  [PASS] C2-3  therefore delta-tau is ALGEBRAICALLY SLAVED to the metric source and falls off as 1/k^2 sub-horizon: delta-tau -> -(a^2 taubar_dot/mu_c^2) S/k^2. It carries no independent growing mode.   (k^2 delta-tau -> -S*a**2*taubar_dot/mu_c**2)
  [PASS] C2-4  ==> ROUTE 1 IS OBSTRUCTED. The clock's V(tau) gives a perfect a^-3 BACKGROUND dust but a perturbation that is slaved and 1/k^2-suppressed, i.e. exactly the 'elliptic field slaved to matter' that the repo's L123(a) already rules out as a third-peak driver. Background dust != clustering dust.

